include LICENSE README.md CONTRIBUTING.md CHANGELOG.md SPEC.md requirements-ui.txt
recursive-include docs *.md *.json *.yml *.sh
recursive-include src/showwork/templates *
recursive-include examples *
recursive-include scripts *.py *.sh
